q=uuid:5655e70a-6150-4ea5-b7e1-03bdfd55b15a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5655e70a-6150-4ea5-b7e1-03bdfd55b15a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-6466&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;2935</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>We are concerned to report a regrettable incident within our esteemed <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>. It has come to our attention that one of the guests, driven to madness by insatiable curiosity, attempted to breach the sanctity of your revered <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope#Boudoir\" title=\"House of Hope\">Boudoir</a>.\n<br><br>\nThe misguided individual, their mind clouded by desperate desire for forbidden knowledge, sought to gain access to your private quarters and uncover the secrets that lie within. They believed that back door on the balcony would serve as their clandestine path to knowledge.\n<br><br>\nHowever, rest assured, <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">My Lord</a>, that our vigilant guardians swiftly intervened and prevented any further trespassing. (So please don't turn us into lemures.)\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201450\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1606/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30785/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argum